{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_a8145b92055e41e3956f847385898384","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<canvas id=\"0:1\" name=\"00 · Start Here 设计任务\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\">\n  <frame id=\"7:2\" name=\"Start Here · Brief\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1440\" height=\"4495\">\n    <frame id=\"7:3\" name=\"Header\" x=\"64\" y=\"64\" width=\"1312\" height=\"176\">\n      <text id=\"7:4\" name=\"LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"182\" height=\"20\" />\n      <text id=\"7:5\" name=\"FinX — mobile banking and trading app\" x=\"0\" y=\"32\" width=\"1312\" height=\"54\" />\n      <text id=\"7:6\" name=\"Design the complete FinX mobile app for Alex Morgan: a banking area (sign up, verify identity, see cards, exchange rates, transactions, budget and profile) and an XTrade trading area (portfolio, crypto market, stock and crypto exchange). Canvas 390 × 844, iPhone. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\" x=\"0\" y=\"98\" width=\"1312\" height=\"78\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"7:7\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"64\" y=\"288\" width=\"1312\" height=\"259\">\n      <text id=\"7:8\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"147\" height=\"36\" />\n      <text id=\"7:9\" name=\"1. Build exactly the 10 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The brand primary color and the typefaces in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself (neutrals, text, surfaces, light / dark mode, gain / loss, success / error / warning / disabled, chart colors), plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator). Design all other states, the headers, both bottom navigations and every business component as reusable components in your file. 5. Use logos, coin icons, banners, the avatar, the ID card placeholder and icons from 04 · Media. 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\" x=\"0\" y=\"52\" width=\"1312\" height=\"207\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"7:10\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"64\" y=\"595\" width=\"1312\" height=\"1937\">\n      <text id=\"7:11\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"413\" height=\"36\" />\n      <text id=\"7:12\" name=\"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\" x=\"0\" y=\"52\" width=\"1312\" height=\"23\" />\n      <frame id=\"7:13\" name=\"Frame cards\" x=\"0\" y=\"91\" width=\"1312\" height=\"1846\">\n        <frame id=\"7:14\" name=\"01_Welcome\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"266\">\n          <text id=\"7:15\" name=\"01_Welcome\" x=\"25\" y=\"25\" width=\"112\" height=\"27\" />\n          <text id=\"7:16\" name=\"Goal: Start using FinX or log in.\" x=\"25\" y=\"62\" width=\"594\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"7:17\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"25\" y=\"93\" width=\"84\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"7:18\" name=\"• Actions: GET STARTED · Log In (“Already have an account?”) • Copy: “Manage your finances simply” • Media: Illustration_Welcome\" x=\"25\" y=\"120\" width=\"594\" height=\"63\" />\n          <text id=\"7:19\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"25\" y=\"193\" width=\"33\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"7:20\" name=\"→ GET STARTED → 02_Photo_ID\" x=\"25\" y=\"220\" width=\"594\" height=\"21\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"7:21\" name=\"02_Photo_ID\" x=\"668\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"287\">\n          <text id=\"7:22\" name=\"02_Photo_ID\" x=\"25\" y=\"25\" width=\"111\" height=\"27\" />\n          <text id=\"7:23\" name=\"Goal: Verify identity by scanning an ID card.\" x=\"25\" y=\"62\" width=\"594\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"7:24\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"25\" y=\"93\" width=\"84\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"7:25\" name=\"• Actions: back · TRY AGAIN · CONTINUE • Camera: the ID card being scanned (ID_Card_Placeholder) • Copy: “Photo ID Card” · “Please point the camera at the ID card”\" x=\"25\" y=\"120\" width=\"594\" height=\"63\" />\n          <text id=\"7:26\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"25\" y=\"193\" width=\"33\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"7:27\" name=\"→ back → 01_Welcome → CONTINUE → 03_Bank_Home\" x=\"25\" y=\"220\" width=\"594\" height=\"42\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"7:28\" name=\"03_Bank_Home\" x=\"0\" y=\"311\" width=\"644\" height=\"350\">\n          <text id=\"7:29\" name=\"03_Bank_Home\" x=\"25\" y=\"25\" width=\"138\" height=\"27\" />\n          <text id=\"7:30\" name=\"Goal: See payment cards, exchange rates and recent transactions.\" x=\"25\" y=\"62\" width=\"594\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"7:31\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"25\" y=\"93\" width=\"84\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"7:32\" name=\"• Actions: menu · contacts · notifications (unread) • Cards: “Payment card” · 2 cards • Exchange rates: “Exchange rates” · AUD / EUR / GBP, each with rate and change · entry to all rates • Main navigation: current tab Home • Transactions: “Transactions” · 3 transactions, newest first · entry to all transactions\" x=\"25\" y=\"120\" width=\"594\" height=\"126\" />\n          <text id=\"7:33\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"25\" y=\"256\" width=\"33\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"7:34\" name=\"→ Transactions entry → 04_Bank_Transactions → tabs → 04 / 03 / 05\" x=\"25\" y=\"283\" width=\"594\" height=\"42\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"7:35\" name=\"04_Bank_Transactions\" x=\"668\" y=\"311\" width=\"644\" height=\"371\">\n          <text id=\"7:36\" name=\"04_Bank_Transactions\" x=\"25\" y=\"25\" width=\"200\" height=\"27\" />\n          <text id=\"7:37\" name=\"Goal: Understand this week’s spending against the monthly budget.\" x=\"25\" y=\"62\" width=\"594\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"7:38\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"25\" y=\"93\" width=\"84\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"7:39\" name=\"• Actions: history · currency exchange · notifications (unread) • Balance: “Total balance” $41,900.10 • Budget: “Monthly budget” · $1,080.24 spent of $2,500 · Food &amp; restaurants $890.12 · Tickets &amp; Journey $190.12 • Copy: “Transactions” • Main navigation: current tab Trans. • Weekly spending: “Transactions” $1,041.90 · period Week (changeable) · spend per day Mon 01 – Sat 06 · selected day: Thu 04, $134.90\" x=\"25\" y=\"120\" width=\"594\" height=\"168\" />\n          <text id=\"7:40\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"25\" y=\"298\" width=\"33\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"7:41\" name=\"→ tabs → 04 / 03 / 05\" x=\"25\" y=\"325\" width=\"594\" height=\"21\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"7:42\" name=\"05_Profile\" x=\"0\" y=\"706\" width=\"644\" height=\"329\">\n          <text id=\"7:43\" name=\"05_Profile\" x=\"25\" y=\"25\" width=\"90\" height=\"27\" />\n          <text id=\"7:44\" name=\"Goal: Review the account and reach settings.\" x=\"25\" y=\"62\" width=\"594\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"7:45\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"25\" y=\"93\" width=\"84\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"7:46\" name=\"• Account: Avatar_User · Alex Morgan · alex.morgan@finx.app · +1 234 567 8901 · edit avatar • Actions: notifications · history · more menu • Main navigation: current tab Profile • Settings: Contact us · Edit profile information · Help &amp; Support · Language: English · Notifications: ON · Privacy policy · Security · Theme: Light mode\" x=\"25\" y=\"120\