Banking: 01_Welcome → 02_Photo_ID → 03_Bank_Home. Trading: 06_XTrade_Welcome → 07_Trade_Home. Two entry points, two areas. • Banking navigation on 03, 04, 05 — five tabs in this order: Trans. (Icon_Tab_Transactions) → 04 · Feeds (Icon_Tab_Feeds, entry only) · Home (Icon_Tab_Home, centre) → 03 · Wallet (Icon_Tab_Wallet, entry only) · Profile (Icon_Tab_Profile) → 05. • Trading navigation on 07, 08, 09, 10 — five tabs in this order: Home (Icon_Tab_Home) → 07 · Markets (Icon_Tab_Markets) → 08 · Exchange (Icon_Tab_Exchange, centre) → 09 · Futures (Icon_Tab_Futures, entry only) · Wallets (Icon_Tab_Wallet, entry only). • The current tab must match the frame. How the navigations look is yours. • Entry only (no frame): Log In, TRY AGAIN, menu, contacts, notifications, history, currency exchange, more menu, settings rows, edit avatar, search, scan, shortcuts, banners, See all, filter, calculator, Chart view, Sell.\" x=\"0\" y=\"52\" width=\"1312\" height=\"184\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"7:87\" name=\"Fixed data &amp; copy\" x=\"64\" y=\"2864\" width=\"1312\" height=\"899\">\n      <text id=\"7:88\" name=\"Fixed data &amp; copy\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"207\" height=\"36\" />\n      <text id=\"7:89\" name=\"Use these values verbatim. Today is Apr 13, 2022. Currency USD unless stated.\" x=\"0\" y=\"52\" width=\"1312\" height=\"23\" />\n      <frame id=\"7:90\" name=\"Data blocks\" x=\"0\" y=\"91\" width=\"1312\" height=\"808\">\n        <frame id=\"7:91\" name=\"User\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"420\" height=\"109\">\n          <text id=\"7:92\" name=\"User\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"33\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"7:93\" name=\"Alex Morgan · alex.morgan@finx.app · +1 234 567 8901 · avatar = Avatar_User\" x=\"20\" y=\"49\" width=\"380\" height=\"40\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"7:94\" name=\"Payment cards\" x=\"444\" y=\"0\" width=\"420\" height=\"149\">\n          <text id=\"7:95\" name=\"Payment cards\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"102\" height=\